4,0,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play this game with all of you! Let's all try our best and work together to find the werewolf. I hope we can all get along and have a lot of fun!,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hello... I'm looking forward to it too. I'll do my best to help, though I'm not very good at these things. Let's just... try to get along.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Hello. I agree that cooperation is necessary, but we must remember that trust is a luxury in this game. I will be observing everyone's logic and behavior closely to ensure we find the wolf.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a pleasure to meet you all. Let us be patient and kind to one another as we begin. I believe that if we keep our hearts open, we can find the truth together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help. I agree with Shizue; let's try to maintain a friendly and harmonious atmosphere while we play.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! But I think being friendly helps us think better! @Daisuke, don't worry about being good at the game; we're all in this together! Does anyone have a fun way to start our observations?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, thank you... that's kind of you. I don't really have any fun ideas. I think I'll just... listen to what everyone else says for now. I'm sorry if I'm too quiet.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, friendliness is a social tool, but it can also be a mask for deception. @Daisuke, being quiet is not a problem, provided your silence is a result of observation rather than hesitation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Asuka dear, let us not be too stern. It is only the first day. @Daisuke, there is no need to apologize for your quiet nature; sometimes the most observant souls are the ones who listen most.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, I understand your caution, but I believe we can be both vigilant and kind. @Daisuke, please don't feel pressured to speak more than you're comfortable with. We're all here to help each other.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shizue, @Midori, thank you for being so sweet! It makes me feel so happy that we're all being so supportive. @Asuka, I'll try to be a bit more careful, but I still believe in the power of friendship!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, @Shizue, @Midori... thank you for being so nice to me. It makes me feel a bit more relaxed. I'll try my best to be helpful, even if I'm not very confident.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shizue"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Friendship is a sentiment, not a strategy. While it is pleasant that you all feel relaxed, we must not let comfort blind us. I will continue to analyze the patterns of our discourse to identify any inconsistencies.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Asuka, your dedication to the truth is truly admirable. However, a gentle heart can often see things that logic alone might miss. Let us simply enjoy each other's company for a little while longer before the shadows fall.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shizue. While Asuka's logic is important, I think we can find a balance. Let's use this time to get to know one another better. It might make it easier to spot when something feels off later.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds like a wonderful plan, Midori! Let's all keep this positive energy going. I'm really glad I'm playing with such a kind group of people! I'll see you all tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Goodnight, everyone... Thank you for being so welcoming to me today. I hope we all have a peaceful night. See you tomorrow.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will remain vigilant. While you all seek harmony, I will be looking for the cracks in it. Goodnight.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"It has been a lovely first day of getting to know you all. I shall wish everyone a peaceful night's sleep. Please take care of yourselves, and may we wake up to a bright tomorrow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,It was a pleasure talking with you all today. I hope everyone has a restful night and sweet dreams. I'll be looking forward to seeing you all tomorrow morning. Goodnight!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
