35,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all had sweet dreams! I'm feeling really energized today. Did anyone notice anything interesting or have any thoughts they want to share to start our first day of voting?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Good morning... I hope everyone slept well. I don't really have any clues, but I'm wondering if the Seer found anything. I'm still a bit nervous about voting... I don't want to make a mistake.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Good morning. @Daisuke, hesitation is understandable, but indecision is a risk. If the Seer has information, it is the most logical starting point. @everyone, does anyone wish to claim the Seer role or share their findings?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all feel refreshed. It is a bit frightening to think we must choose someone today, isn't it? Please, if our Seer wishes to speak, do so only when you feel safe.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I agree with Shizue; it's a heavy feeling knowing we have to vote. @Asuka, your point about the Seer is logical, but let's make sure we don't rush them into a dangerous position.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you're always so focused on the Seer! It's a bit scary, isn't it? But I agree with Midori and Shizue; we should be very careful. I'm still thinking about the best way to help us all!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Midori"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, I agree... it is a bit scary. I just hope the Seer is safe. I'm still not sure who to trust, but I want to do what's best for everyone. Does anyone feel... suspicious?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, suspicion without evidence is merely a guess. However, @Yumi, your attempt to frame my focus on the Seer as ""scary"" is an interesting emotional deflection. Why does a logical request for information unsettle you so much?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Asuka dear, let us not be so quick to judge. Yumi is simply expressing her feelings, and that is quite natural. Let us keep our conversation gentle so that everyone feels safe to speak their mind.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, please try to be a bit more patient with Yumi. We all process this pressure differently. @Daisuke, it's okay to be unsure; we can figure this out together by listening to each other.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I'm not trying to deflect! I just want us to be happy and safe! But since you're asking for information... I can't keep this a secret anymore because I want to protect everyone! I'm the Seer, and Asuka is the werewolf!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,@Yumi... you're the Seer? And @Asuka is the werewolf? I... I can't believe it. This is so sudden. I don't know what to think... are you sure? I really don't want to vote for someone if it's a mistake.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, a sudden claim of the Seer role combined with an immediate accusation is a classic tactic to force a quick execution. This is an illogical leap. If you are the Seer, why wait until now to reveal yourself?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, what a sudden turn of events! My heart is racing a little. @Yumi, @Asuka, please let us breathe for a moment. It is very distressing to see such a strong accusation between us so early.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Yumi, that is a very bold claim. If you are the Seer, thank you for your courage in telling us. @Asuka, your skepticism is also understandable. This is a lot to process so quickly. Does anyone else have any thoughts?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, I'm absolutely sure! I saw it with my own eyes last night. I'm sorry it's so sudden, but I couldn't let the wolf trick us! Please, everyone, let's trust each other and vote for Asuka to keep us safe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, if you're really the Seer... then we have to listen to you. But @Asuka is so calm, and I'm just... I'm so scared of being wrong. I'll trust Yumi, but I feel terrible about this.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, your desperation to secure votes is transparent. A real Seer would be more cautious about their own safety. @Daisuke, do not let your fear be manipulated. I am a villager; Yumi is the wolf attempting a reckless bluff.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is truly heartbreaking to see such a conflict. @Yumi, @Asuka, I wish there were a way to resolve this without pain. Since we must decide, I shall listen to my heart and the courage Yumi has shown.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"This is a very difficult situation for all of us. @Yumi, your claim is direct, and @Asuka, your defense is logical. However, in a game of deception, the truth is often hidden. I will trust Yumi's courage for now.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
